The Zalo plugin is a derivative work of zalo-agent and drives personal Zalo accounts through zca-js. Both are
MIT-licensed; their copyright and permission notices are reproduced below as the MIT license requires.

1. zalo-agent

Source: https://github.com/vuhai2002/zalo-agent, version 0.3.1, commit bf154de68335e73073c2b6913c731be22ca3d0e6.
The plugin's Python code is a translation of its TypeScript src/zalo, src/zalo-bot and the account handling of
src/config and src/server (files start with "# ported from: src/<path>.ts").

