2. zca-js

Source: https://github.com/RFS-ADRENO/zca-js (npm package zca-js 2.1.2). Not translated and not vendored: the
plugin's Node bridge uses it as an unmodified npm dependency. zca-js is an UNOFFICIAL, reverse-engineered client;
using it can get the account locked.

